{
  "title": "SNS · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "하나의 알림을 여러 구독 대상에 전달합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>SNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Notification Service)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#guide-1\">발행과 구독</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#guide-2\">작업을 놓치지 않고 분리하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>50 / 62</span></div><h1>SNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Notification Service)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>SNS는 <strong>발행한 메시지를 구독 중인 여러 대상에 전달하는 알림 서비스</strong>입니다. 발행자는 주제인 토픽에 메시지를 보내고, 구독자는 지원되는 방식으로 전달받습니다.</p><p>하나의 주문 완료 이벤트를 여러 처리 시스템에 알리거나 운영 알림을 여러 채널로 보낼 때 사용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"topics-publishers-and-subscriptions\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"standard-topics\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"fifo-topics\"></span><h2>발행과 구독</h2><p>토픽을 만들고 전달받을 대상을 구독으로 등록합니다. 구독 방식에 따라 SQS, Lambda, HTTP 엔드포인트, 이메일 등을 사용할 수 있습니다.</p><p>발행자는 각 구독자의 주소를 직접 관리하지 않고 토픽에 전송합니다. 구독 필터를 사용하면 메시지의 속성이나 내용에 따라 필요한 알림만 받도록 할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"subscription-filter-policies\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"fan-out-with-sqs\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"delivery-retries-and-dead-letter-queues\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"security-and-observability\"></span><h2>작업을 놓치지 않고 분리하기</h2><p>여러 시스템이 각자의 속도로 처리해야 한다면 SNS에서 각 시스템의 SQS 큐로 보내는 팬아웃<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 구성을 사용할 수 있습니다. 시스템마다 독립된 재시도와 작업 보관이 가능해집니다.</p><p>전달 실패의 재시도와 DLQ 지원은 구독 대상과 토픽 유형에 맞춰 확인합니다. 순서가 중요한 작업은 FIFO 토픽과 지원되는 구독 구성을 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>하나의 이벤트를 여러 곳에 전달</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>이벤트 발행</strong><span>토픽에 메시지 전송</span></li><li><strong>SNS 토픽</strong><span>구독·필터에 따라 전달</span></li><li><strong>여러 구독자</strong><span>각 시스템에서 처리</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">동일 이벤트를 여러 독립된 소비자가 받아야 할 때 사용합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>주문 완료 이벤트를 SNS에 발행하고 배송, 정산, 이메일 시스템의 SQS 큐가 각각 구독합니다. 한 시스템의 처리가 늦어도 다른 시스템은 계속 진행합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>팬아웃</strong> — 하나의 입력을 여러 독립된 대상으로 나누어 전달하는 패턴입니다. 각 대상이 동일한 이벤트에 대해 서로 다른 작업을 수행할 수 있습니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sns/latest/dg/welcome.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon SNS? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q073\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,1\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q092\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q074\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q074\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q074</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q074/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to filter EC2 instance state-change events and send matching events to Lambda using a Classic event bus and rules. Which service provides this capability?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront caching</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EventBridge</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> 규칙이 이벤트 패턴을 걸러 대상에 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q071\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q071\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q071</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order API hands work to asynchronous workers and must retry tasks when a worker fails. Which service should buffer the work?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>로 생산자와 소비자를 분리하고 메시지 삭제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">visibility timeout</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q072\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q072\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q072</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q072/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A worker receives an SQS message but fails before deleting it. What generally happens?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The message disappears permanently</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A new message is always inserted at the back of the queue</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The message automatically moves to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The message can be received again after the visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 메시지는 삭제 전까지 큐에 남고 숨김 시간이 끝나면 다시 보일 수 있다. 표준 큐에서는 순서를 가정하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">이전 용어 <b>Snowball Edge</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">다음 용어 <b>SQS</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
